step by step how to use this code


step 1 open your xampp 

step 2 paste this database

-- Create database
CREATE DATABASE IF NOT EXISTS linknest_db;
USE linknest_db;

-- Users table
CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS users (
    id INT AUTO_INCREMENT PRIMARY KEY,
    email VARCHAR(255) UNIQUE NOT NULL,
    password VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL,
    name VARCHAR(100) NOT NULL,
    join_date DATE NOT NULL,
    plan VARCHAR(50) DEFAULT 'Free',
    preferences JSON,
    stats JSON,
    created_at TIMESTAMP DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP
);

step 3 open your command prompt and paste this

xcopy "C:\Users\Administrator\Desktop\BookWeb" "C:\xampp\htdocs\BookWeb" /E /I /H /Y

it's depends of your users name and administrator file url

